message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "100 Drone Simulation Applications"
abstract: >-
  A systematic study of 100 drone simulation scenarios across five domains
  (pursuit and evasion, logistics and delivery, environmental monitoring and
  search and rescue, industry and agriculture, special operations and
  entertainment), each with a scenario card, a Python implementation and
  Matplotlib 3D visualisations.
